    "name": "What Affects the Cost of a Room Addition in San Diego County?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of a Room Addition in San Diego County?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "How much a room addition costs depends on the size and purpose of the space, foundation and soil conditions, structural connection to the existing home, plumbing and electrical work, finishes, design complexity, permit requirements, and necessary upgrades to the existing property. A reliable estimate requires a project-specific review rather than a broad per-square-foot assumption.",
